# LAN-only / placeholder / auth-walled hosts lychee cannot meaningfully verify
# from CI (estate item #15 — external link-rot checking; internal links are
# covered by zensical --strict at build).
.*\$\{SECRET_DOMAIN\}.*
https?://[^/]*webgrip\.dev.*
https?://[^/]*\.svc(\.cluster\.local)?.*
https?://(10|172|192)\..*
https?://localhost.*
mailto:.*
